{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cet8S4WhjdQhTkhJSSy6q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coconut Context is the flagship product I've been using directly this session \u2014 that's the source for the second sentence.\n\n**What Coconut does:** Coconut is a \"command, control, and communications\" platform for provisioning, managing, and orchestrating AI agent instances \u2014 including a Dashboard for managing tasks/knowledge/resources across instances and a Studio for configuring a given instance's skills, MCP servers, and integrations (`products/index.md`). Its core is Coconut Context, a living, markdown-first context layer \u2014 accessible via web, MCP, CLI, and SDK \u2014 that grounds AI interactions (human or agent) in shared, current knowledge so answers stay accurate rather than guessed (`products/index.md`).\n\nNote: `products/context/index.md` (the dedicated Context product page) is currently just a stub marked \"TBD,\" so I pulled the Context description from the overview page rather than a fuller spec \u2014 worth flagging if you need more detail for a prospect-facing deck."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_read_input_tokens":16009,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-09T15:48:47.337Z","request_id":"req_011Cet8S3q1ma9zZeTSrA56d"}
